Шаблон 1 — Простая клавиша (например, Enter)
  - platform: template
    name: "Send Enter"
    id: send_enter
    icon: mdi:keyboard-return
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.press:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            code: 0x28   # HID keycode for Enter
Шаблон 2 — Комбинация клавиш (например, Ctrl+Alt+Delete)
  - platform: template
    name: "Send Ctrl+Alt+Delete"
    id: send_cad
    icon: mdi:apple-keyboard-control
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.combination:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            delay: 100ms
            keys:
              - 0x01      # Left Ctrl (HID modifier bit)
              - 0x04      # Left Alt (HID modifier bit)
              - "0x4C"    # Delete keycode
Шаблон 3 — Печать произвольного текста из Home Assistant
text_sensor:
  - platform: homeassistant
    id: text_to_type
    entity_id: input_text.ble_remote_message   # create this helper in HA
    internal: true

button:
  - platform: template
    name: "Type Message"
    id: type_message
    icon: mdi:keyboard-outline
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.print:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            text: !lambda "return id(text_to_type).state;"
Шаблон 4 — Произвольная медиа-клавиша по коду (например, Mute)
  - platform: template
    name: "Mute"
    id: mute_toggle
    icon: mdi:volume-mute
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.press:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            code: [0xE2, 0x00]   # HID Consumer Control: Mute
Шаблон 5 — Управление презентацией / стрелки (например, для доклада)
  - platform: template
    name: "Slide Next"
    id: slide_next
    icon: mdi:arrow-right-bold
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.press:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            code: 0x4F   # Right Arrow

  - platform: template
    name: "Slide Previous"
    id: slide_previous
    icon: mdi:arrow-left-bold
    on_press:
      then:
        - ble_keyboard.press:
            id: my_ble_keyboard
            code: 0x50   # Left Arrow
